OL,5,G1500 The Things They Carried
OL,6,     F2/2. Alpha Company digs one of
OL,7,     Ftheir own out of the Vietnam mud.
OL,8,     FThe guilt of that night will
OL,9,     Ffollow them home. Tim O'Brien must
OL,10,     Fdecide how much of it he is ready
OL,11,     Fto tell.
OL,12,G1600 Take Four Books
OL,13,     FSebastian Barry speaks to Take
OL,14,     FFour Books about his latest novel,
OL,15,     FThe Newer World, and, together
OL,16,     Fwith presenter James Crawford,
OL,17,     Fthey explore its connections to
OL,18,     Fthree other books.
