OL,5,G1700 Witness History
OL,6,     FIn 1962, cameras were allowed into
OL,7,     Fthe renovated White House for the
OL,8,     Ffirst televised tour. And, acting
OL,9,     Fas the guide, was one of America's
OL,10,     Fmost famous first ladies, Jackie
OL,11,     FKennedy.
OL,12,G1710 All Kinds of Minds
OL,13,     F3/4. Nathan Filer explores what it
OL,14,     Fmeans for adults who are diagnosed
OL,15,     Fwith neurodevelopmental disorders,
OL,16,     Fand how they navigate its impact
OL,17,     Fin work, relationships and
OL,18,     Feveryday life.
